Provenance
================================================================================

Every source file states whether it is original work or adapted from a
third-party implementation.

As of this revision, all files under packages/*/src are original work. No code
has been adapted from `feelin` or from any other FEEL implementation. Test
*expectations* recording the observed behaviour of reference engines (Drools,
jDMN) are facts about those engines rather than copies of them.

If a future change adapts third-party source, that file must carry the
originating copyright notice and license, and this section must be updated in
the same commit.
